abstract: "A public draft for corrigible self-improving AI. Version 2.2 separates core principles, governance/evidence/enforcement, and implementation profiles; it adds independent evidence requirements, meta-governance, multi-source adjudication, irreversible-action thresholds, graduated enforcement, and anti-lock-in safeguards."
